        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result of the materiality assessment, we determined that the most material environmental issues to our business are: (i) emissions from company-owned trucks that deliver our products;",
        "start_character": 34431,
        "end_character": 34619
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business is relationship-based, and we operate under the following trade names:",
        "start_character": 6311,
        "end_character": 6394
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The overwhelming majority of our operations involve the processing and distribution of aluminum and steel products that we believe are highly recyclable and supportive of circular manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 32869,
        "end_character": 33063
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are not a metals producer or mill – we operate metals service centers that process and distribute metal products.",
        "start_character": 32662,
        "end_character": 32778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are required to undertake due diligence, disclose and report whether the products we sell originate from the Democratic Republic of Congo and adjoining countries.",
        "start_character": 31149,
        "end_character": 31314
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our competitors are generally unable to offer the same high-quality products and services we provide using state-of-the-art equipment and advanced technology as they do not have the financial ability or risk tolerance to invest in or grow their businesses at the same rate as Reliance.",
        "start_character": 24591,
        "end_character": 24887
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our industry-leading financial results in recent years are attributable to our strong financial condition, the high quality of products and services we are able to offer as a result of our significant investments in the facilities and equipment of our existing and acquired businesses, as well as our continued focus on small order sizes with quick turnaround.",
        "start_character": 24888,
        "end_character": 25259
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our relatively low market share, based on the reported shipment levels for the metals service center industry, provides us with a significant opportunity for growth.",
        "start_character": 11994,
        "end_character": 12170
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that few other metals service centers offer the breadth of processing services and metals that we provide.",
        "start_character": 3604,
        "end_character": 3721
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we have the ability to quickly adjust our selling prices in response to increases in raw material costs that are demand-driven in order to maintain consistency in our gross profit margin as only a small portion of our business is subject to long-term contractual pricing arrangements.",
        "start_character": 5228,
        "end_character": 5523
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide a wide variety of processing services to meet our customers’ specifications and deliver products to fabricators, manufacturers and other end users.",
        "start_character": 3445,
        "end_character": 3603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020651",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020651-a4f5519a94e28071",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020651",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we have many large original equipment manufacturer customers, most of our sales are to small machine shops and fabricators, in small quantities with frequent and often just-in-time deliveries, ensuring as-needed logistics and helping them manage their working capital and credit needs more efficiently.",
        "start_character": 17507,
        "end_character": 17818
      }
    ]
  },
